flag provided but not defined: -log-level
Usage of ./gost:
  -C string
    	configuration file
  -D	debug mode
  -DD
    	trace mode
  -F value
    	chain node list
  -L value
    	service list
  -O string
    	output format, one of yaml|json format
  -V	print version
  -api string
    	api service address
  -metrics string
    	metrics service address
